{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"852796918836232192","content":"Pilot actions:\nAction: Weather Gage. Choose one other ship in your zone. Make a pilot check DC20 to gain advantage on attack rolls against that ship until the end of your ship’s turn. This applies to all crew members and includes personal attack rolls. You can have the weather gage on more than one other ship at a time.\n\nAction: Close the Distance. Move toward target aircraft in the same zone. Make a pilot check DC10 to bring ships within “Close Range” (allows Boarding, Bombing, and Personal attacks, range of 10-30’). After your ship’s turn ends, you are no longer at “Close Range”. As part of this action, you can choose to Ram the enemy ship causing 3d10 bludgeoning damage to both ships as if hit.\n\nAction: Full ahead. Move into adjacent zone. \n\nReaction: Swerve. Pass a Pilot check DC 20 to cause one attack roll against your ship to fail.","created_at":"2021-07-13T13:43:50.873000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-13T13:44:01.178000Z","id":"864502387565527067","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
